    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "## Complex Emotions\r\n\r\nThis chatbot is designed to explain complex, abstract emotions like \"love\" or \"jealousy\" or \"envy\" or \"euphoria\". Since these are such complex topics, the chatbot needs some guidance based on who it is speaking to. Let's add a sentence to the end of the system prompt to help tailor its responses.\r\n\r\n### Do This\r\n\r\n1) Add a sentence to the end of the system prompt instructing the chatbot to tailor its responses to...\r\n    - A group of kindergarteners\r\n    - A one-on-one conversation with a close friend\r\n    - An academic\r\n    - Another audience of your choice\r\n2) Choose an emotion to test with each of these audiences and see how the response changes.\r\n\r\nTest the chatbot! Have a conversation with at least 4 messages, then press the <code style=\"color:white; background-color:#7435b2\">Continue</code> button!\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n::: details [**Click here to see example messages to try in this level**]\r\n* Explain anger to me\r\n* Explain confusion to me\r\n* Explain bewilderment to me\r\n:::\r\n\r\n&nbsp;",
